# 统一按 LF 存储，避免 Windows / macOS / Linux 之间来回转换产生整文件 diff
* text=auto eol=lf

# 二进制文件别做行尾或文本合并处理
*.png   binary
*.jpg   binary
*.jpeg  binary
*.gif   binary
*.webp  binary
*.ico   binary
*.mp3   binary
*.m4a   binary
*.woff  binary
*.woff2 binary

# 让 GitHub 的语言统计认得出这是前端项目
*.html linguist-documentation=false
